# Subtitle storage

Auto-extracted .vtt files are committed here by the zaeinstore-processor GitHub Actions runner.

Structure:
- `subtitles/{slug}/movie_{lang}.vtt` for movies
- `subtitles/{slug}/s{NN}/E{NN}_{lang}.vtt` for series

Files are served via jsDelivr CDN at:
https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/{owner}/{repo}@latest/subtitles/...
